{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B5641C6A","title":"You Found Something","entry":"Dlg_B5641C6A::entry","exit":"Dlg_B5641C6A::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_95A6CC4C","articyId":"72057697117143980","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Hey, so... what um, what happens to be in that pocket of yours? And don't lie to me. We're past the point of lying.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, so... what um, what happens to be in that pocket of yours? And don't lie to me. We're past the point of lying.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-175.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17928","byteOffset":14670920,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_DCBCC0A8","articyId":"72057697117144015","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"A what?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A what?","TextSheVersion":"A what?","TextTheyVersion":"A what?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30739","byteOffset":19509360,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_83C7265D","articyId":"72057697117144032","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"It's a shimmer coin. You never seen one? Where the blood-slicked tram tracks did you come from? They have raised images on one side, a trick of the nanolights on its surface.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's a shimmer coin. You never seen one? Where the blood-slicked tram tracks did you come from? They have raised images on one side, a trick of the nanolights on its surface.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","de